proposed_changes.description:
New unit tests, six of them:
- unfilled slots abstain (occupation, name, quantity, frequency);
- filled slots and unslotted questions answer;
- a slot filled only by a source with a positive logit counts, but one filled only by a negative-logit, non-best source does not;
- the logit floor fires, and tau=0 disables it;
- the rule is a no-op for reranker status disabled or fallback, for legacy contexts without scores, and when abstain_threshold is None;
- the Gemini path is unchanged, and an out-of-range threshold raises.
The full file is at /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-josephremingstonl-Downloads-code-capstone/2d91e859-4acd-4fbf-99c1-146f2e2aa197/scratchpad/design/abstention/repo/tests/test_abstention.py (diff: .../diffs/test_abstention.py.diff).
